{"id": "EUVD-2026-86186", "enisaUuid": "fb7c1997-6d8b-3667-bdda-342be600196d", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: iwlwifi: mvm: validate sta_id in BA window status notif\n\nBA_WINDOW_STATUS_NOTIFICATION_ID extracts a 5-bit sta_id from the\nfirmware notification and uses it to index fw_id_to_mac_id[] without\nbounds checking. Validate sta_id before array access to prevent\nout-of-bounds indexing.", "datePublished": "2026-09-24T16:02:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-03T10:57:33", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f9938eb95e2ddab4a58d3946a320abcbd60b56a4", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bb08fbbbd5568d33069485ecb0a1657f115a4e9f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e35ae757c6462bfd3437bf58121bb721fe1f790c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6aa77efaea9efea92e3090c35ad348fd759a3cf3"], "aliases": ["GHSA-537c-46r9-4j6g", "CVE-2026-93799"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1714f4b7-0836-3452-acab-7a83375f17bc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3af512d6aac7eb6420086f124abb4426f5f4b369 <f9938eb95e2ddab4a58d3946a320abcbd60b56a4"}, {"id": "252eebaa-3752-337c-8df2-970c711c8db7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.53"}, {"id": "28cda9a5-0ee6-3362-98f0-2ed489f9d154", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.158"}, {"id": "2df9e3fe-adff-3396-9bc0-8268cf6be8ee", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "4.6"}, {"id": "54b7e27d-d5be-32fb-86c8-38b2b5147942", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "56f434a4-920b-3eb9-bf31-1e3729cac5eb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3af512d6aac7eb6420086f124a